This repository mixes two bodies of work with different terms.

1. skills/openmontage/  — derived from calesthio/OpenMontage, licensed AGPLv3.
   The full licence text is at skills/openmontage/LICENSE.
   Any reuse of that material is governed by AGPLv3.

2. Everything else (skills/ytshort/, workflows/, scripts/, docs/, this file)
   — original work by the repository owner.

If you are unsure which part you are looking at: if it is under
skills/openmontage/, assume AGPLv3.
